realpc-clean-build
==================

This repository rebuilds the open parts of AICodo/pve-emu-realpc from source and adds open
reimplementations of its closed "Strong" pieces. It distributes BUILD TOOLING, SOURCE PATCHES
and SCRIPTS — not the upstream projects' code, which is fetched from its official sources at
build time.

